      "text": "his family, which consisted of my mother, 1 Ne. 2:5. virgin … mother of the Son of God, 1 Ne. 11:18. I beheld that their mother Gentiles were gathered, 1 Ne. 13:17. abominable church … mother of harlots, 1 Ne. 13:34. great and abominable church … mother of abominations, 1 Ne. 14:9 (D&C 88:94). grieved because of the afflictions of their mother, 1 Ne. 18:19. in the days of my greatest sorrow did thy mother bear thee, 2 Ne. 3:1. flesh must … crumble to its mother earth, 2 Ne. 9:7 (Mosiah 2:26; Morm. 6:15). I will graft in unto them the branches of their mother tree, Jacob 5:54. his mother shall be called Mary, Mosiah 3:8. they had been taught by their mothers, Alma 56:47. remember the words … their mothers had taught them, Alma 57:21. then would our mothers … have been spared, 3 Ne. 8:25. ye fathers and mothers … how is it that ye could have fallen, Morm. 6:19.",
